        "by": "human",
        "reason": "Joins its dependency on a MIMIC identifier: 'com' groups by e.hadm_id_str and 'scored' reaches age via ON c.hadm_id = a.hadm_id. The published age Library no longer carries hadm_id -- age emits patient_key/encounter_key and the export drops the identifiers those replace -- so the shipped charlson SQL references a column that does not exist in its dependency. Re-map onto encounter_key: GROUP BY e.encounter_key in 'com', project src_age.encounter_key in 'ag', and join both on e.encounter_key. Keep WHERE e.hadm_id_str IS NOT NULL as-is: it selects the hospital stream and has no key equivalent.",
